cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "TetrisCNN"
abstract: >-
  Companion code for "TetrisCNN for interpretable detection of phases of matter
  from experimental quantum simulator data": an interpretable convolutional
  network whose latent variables admit a reading in terms of spin correlators,
  applied to Rydberg-array snapshots of two-dimensional Ising and XY models.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/kcybinski/TetrisCNN_for_spin_systems"
